# ANSWER FORMAT
Answer with exactly one JSON object and no text before or after it.
If nothing needs to change: {{"changed": false}}
If something needs to change: {{"changed": true, "reason": "the concrete fact from the results", "steps": [{{"goal": "...", "tool": "...", "checkpoint_criteria": "...", "user_input_expected": false, "source_step": null}}]}}
The "steps" field holds the FULL new list of remaining steps in order. An empty list is valid — it means no remaining work.
